WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:07.774
Russia marked Orthodox Easter in Ukraine

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:09.909
with a barrage of missiles

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:10.944
with a church

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:13.279
among the targets on Easter Sunday.

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:15.315
Villagers search the rubble

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:16.216
near the city of

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:17.350
Aparicio, where

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.652
their church suffered massive damage

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.788
No services were underway

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:24.290
when the missile hit and no one was hurt.

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:26.426
But the head of the local military

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:29.596
was incensed, saying nothing is sacred.

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:32.932
And there was no lull in the ferocious

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:35.035
fighting in and around back Mort.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:37.937
Ukraine says almost 100 Russian shellings

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:39.773
were recorded around the city

00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:41.708
in just 24 hours,

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.877
and about 30 firefights

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:46.012
raged between Ukrainian

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:47.647
and Russian forces

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:49.749
for control of the devastated city.

00:00:50.183 --> 00:00:51.551
But there was also

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:53.586
a little joy on this holiday.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:56.523
130 Ukrainians are now free

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:59.059
after a prisoner exchange with Russia

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.395
Russian President Vladimir Putin met

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:03.063
with Chinese

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:03.930
Defense Minister

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:06.833
Li Sheng Fu in Moscow on Sunday,

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:07.967
just weeks

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:09.569
after Chinese leader

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:12.005
Xi Jinping also visited the country.

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:12.639
Mr.

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:14.507
Putin told Li that President

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:15.341
Xi's visit

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:17.010
was, quote, very productive

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:19.112
and he praised their countries

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:21.915
bilateral cooperation in multiple areas,

00:01:22.182 --> 00:01:23.616
including the military

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:26.853
and we hear them.

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:27.187
There is

00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:29.122
a very good development of relations

00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:31.124
between our countries in all areas

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:32.258
in the economic,

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:35.095
social, cultural and educational sectors.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.297
But we are also working actively

00:01:37.297 --> 00:01:40.366
through the military departments

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:42.168
And this was Lee's

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.436
first foreign trip

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:45.405
since becoming defense minister.

00:01:45.405 --> 00:01:46.639
He emphasized the,

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:47.941
quote, special character

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:50.643
and strategic importance of the Moscow

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:52.812
Beijing relationship.

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:54.080
CNN's Clare Sebastian

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:54.814
is following

00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:56.082
all these developments for us.

00:01:56.082 --> 00:01:57.817
She joins us live from London.

00:01:57.817 --> 00:01:59.152
Good morning to Claire.

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:00.453
So President Putin met

00:02:00.453 --> 00:02:01.921
with China's defense minister.

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:03.990
What came out of that meeting?

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:04.824
Yeah, Rosemary.

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:06.126
Nothing concrete,

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:07.827
although obviously that was a meeting

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:08.361
that was going to be

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:09.662
very closely watched.

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:11.131
Given what we know, about the U.S.

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:13.266
concerns that China may be considering

00:02:13.266 --> 00:02:14.767
supplying military aid

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:16.803
for Russia's war in Ukraine.

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:18.872
Nothing obvious came out.

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:20.206
But these optics matter

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:21.808
this is the third high level

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:23.076
Chinese visit to Moscow

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:24.077
in as many months.

00:02:24.077 --> 00:02:24.844
We first had the top

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:25.712
diplomat, then, as you

00:02:25.712 --> 00:02:26.613
mentioned, the president

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:27.780
himself, Xi Jinping.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.749
And now the new defense minister

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:32.852
in his first overseas trip in that role.

00:02:32.886 --> 00:02:34.687
Very significant

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:36.156
to see the commitment,

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:38.958
the level of engagement on both sides.

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:40.560
And I think to some degree,

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:41.194
the target

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:42.795
audience of those optics

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:44.063
was the United States,

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:45.231
the Chinese defense minister

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:46.866
not missing an opportunity

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:48.368
to mention the Cold War,

00:02:48.368 --> 00:02:49.802
saying that Moscow and Beijing

00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:51.171
have very strong relations

00:02:51.171 --> 00:02:52.405
that far surpassed

00:02:52.405 --> 00:02:54.207
the military political alliances

00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:55.341
of the Cold War.

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:57.177
I think a pretty clear statement

00:02:57.177 --> 00:02:59.779
on the fact that both sides are hoping

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:01.114
this relationship will serve

00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:02.549
as a counterpoint

00:03:02.549 --> 00:03:04.551
to the US led alliance and its support

00:03:05.051 --> 00:03:06.386
for Ukraine, even though,

00:03:06.386 --> 00:03:08.421
of course, publicly, Beijing

00:03:08.421 --> 00:03:10.456
has not officially expressed support

00:03:10.657 --> 00:03:13.259
for Russia's war, it continues to foster

00:03:13.459 --> 00:03:14.594
that relationship.

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:16.095
So, as I say, no concrete

00:03:16.095 --> 00:03:17.797
steps emerging from this meeting,

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:19.465
but very significant updates

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:19.966
as we watch

00:03:19.966 --> 00:03:22.302
how this relationship unfolds. Unclear.

00:03:22.335 --> 00:03:23.736
What is the latest on

00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:25.505
fighting around Vamos?

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:27.507
So an

00:03:27.507 --> 00:03:30.109
exceptionally violent, bloody weekend

00:03:30.143 --> 00:03:30.643
for as many,

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:32.612
according to the Ukrainian side,

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:34.113
the spokesperson for the eastern

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:36.182
grouping of the Ukrainian armed forces

00:03:36.182 --> 00:03:37.850
said that there was an unprecedented

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:39.919
in recent decades level

00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:41.487
of fighting over the weekend,

00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:42.555
and that has continued

00:03:42.555 --> 00:03:43.790
into Monday morning.

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:44.791
The Ukrainian general staff

00:03:44.791 --> 00:03:46.859
saying that Russia is attacking

00:03:46.859 --> 00:03:47.627
its suburbs,

00:03:47.627 --> 00:03:48.494
including locations

00:03:48.494 --> 00:03:49.629
on the supply routes

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:50.930
that Ukraine uses

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:53.533
to get food and medicine ammunition in

00:03:53.533 --> 00:03:55.568
and of course, wounded soldiers out.

00:03:55.568 --> 00:03:56.769
They have said in recent days

00:03:56.769 --> 00:03:57.770
that their supply routes

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:58.571
remain open,

00:03:58.571 --> 00:03:59.239
but clearly

00:03:59.239 --> 00:04:01.274
they are coming under attack now.

00:04:01.307 --> 00:04:02.742
Also over the weekend,

00:04:02.742 --> 00:04:03.910
the Russian Ministry of Defense

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:04.978
reported that Wagner

00:04:04.978 --> 00:04:07.180
had captured two districts to the north

00:04:07.447 --> 00:04:09.082
and south of Buchman.

00:04:09.082 --> 00:04:09.716
We have not been able

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:11.184
to independently verify that,

00:04:11.184 --> 00:04:12.585
but I think that shows,

00:04:12.585 --> 00:04:12.852
you know,

00:04:12.852 --> 00:04:15.021
eight and a half months into this battle

00:04:15.388 --> 00:04:16.923
just how incremental it still

00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:18.925
is to districts in a town

00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:20.493
that had a pre-war population

00:04:20.493 --> 00:04:22.528
of only 70,000 Rosemary.

00:04:22.795 --> 00:04:23.263
All right.

00:04:23.263 --> 00:04:24.497
Our thanks to Clare Sebastian

00:04:24.497 --> 00:04:25.965
joining us live from London.

